                "title": "Ice White Porcelain Knobset with Regular Rosette",
                "description": "The Ice White Porcelain Knobset with Regular Rosette is great for restoration projects. The White Porcelain Knob has a pure, clean color that helps bring out the vibrance of the rosette's finish, no matter which of the stunning array of colors you choose. The Traditional White Porcelain Knob with Regular Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
